&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://skillbuilder.aws/learning-plan/3HCD821CNZ/aws-simulearn-ai-practitioner/BFKGA5VM8H" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;AWS SimuLearn AI Practitioner&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With Skill Builder subscription ($29/month or $299/year):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

